 of $f(x)$ lies in the first and third quadrants"] ["question-98e4ebcc-8114-515c-b8a9-5feafd8f7bb3" :question/worked-solution "Let's start by recalling the graph of $y=\\sqrt[3]{x}.$\n\n![](images/ab/abafb7d55b4baa0b06f20c3de2b44d5925f7286f078aaa76d71aded7c9c9a001.png)\n\nNow, let's examine each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false since $f(x)\\to -\\infty $ as $x\\to -\\infty .$\n\n- Statement II is false since the range of $f(x)=\\sqrt[3]{x}$ is $(-\\infty ,\\infty ).$\n\n- Statement III is true. Indeed, the graph of $f(x)$ lies in the first and third quadrants.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\""] ["question-98e4ebcc-8114-515c-b8a9-5feafd8f7bb3" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-61b564d7-3dd3-5be8-b00c-7d4c0105b021" :answer-field/id #uuid "61b564d7-3dd3-5be8-b00c-7d4c0105b021"] ["answer-ff18e589-7302-5c48-9ca4-e66cc9290084" :answer/id #uuid "ff18e589-7302-5c48-9ca4-e66cc9290084"] ["answer-ff18e589-7302-5c48-9ca4-e66cc9290084" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-ff18e589-7302-5c48-9ca4-e66cc9290084" :answer/value "I and III only"] ["answer-955053f1-ca40-507d-adfd-f164744f1aaa" :answer/id #uuid "955053f1-ca40-507d-adfd-f164744f1aaa"] ["answer-955053f1-ca40-507d-adfd-f164744f1aaa" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-955053f1-ca40-507d-adfd-f164744f1aaa" :answer/value "I only"] ["answer-e7dc61b4-da33-58f5-acc1-5cb4210241cf" :answer/id #uuid "e7dc61b4-da33-58f5-acc1-5cb4210241cf"] ["answer-e7dc61b4-da33-58f5-acc1-5cb4210241cf" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-e7dc61b4-da33-58f5-acc1-5cb4210241cf" :answer/value "II and III only"] ["answer-46095390-0a49-5a60-94b9-d4b2808b83a9" :answer/id #uuid "46095390-0a49-5a60-94b9-d4b2808b83a9"] ["answer-46095390-0a49-5a60-94b9-d4b2808b83a9" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-46095390-0a49-5a60-94b9-d4b2808b83a9" :answer/value "II only"] ["answer-1e8a624a-766c-5521-a7e0-68fa10357b2c" :answer/id #uuid "1e8a624a-766c-5521-a7e0-68fa10357b2c"] ["answer-1e8a6